guide forever-dungeon-quests/wailing-caverns-alliance
title Wailing Caverns (Alliance)
category Dungeons
folder Wailing Caverns
faction Alliance
levels 17-24
zone The Barrens
keywords Wailing Caverns, The Barrens, Ratchet, Nalpak, Ebru, Mebok Mizzyrix, Bigglefuzz, Mad Magglish, Sputtervalve, Falla Sagewind, Anacondra, Cobrahn, Kresh, Pythas, Skum, Serpentis, Verdan, Mutanus, Glowing Shard, deviate, dungeon
