why Every Alliance quest of the Wailing Caverns in one run, lead-in included.

# The Wailing Caverns' Alliance quests in one guide: Ratchet's pick-ups, the
# druids at the caverns, one run, then the hand-ins. Steps already done are
# passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The quests: Mebok Mizzyrix's 865 Raptor Horns -> 1491 Smart Drinks (Wailing
# Essence); Crane Operator Bigglefuzz's 959 Trouble at the Docks (Mad
# Magglish's port); Nalpak's 1486 Deviate Hides and Ebru's 1487 Deviate
# Eradication; Mutanus's Glowing Shard (item 10441) starts 6981 The Glowing
# Shard (Sputtervalve in Ratchet, then Falla Sagewind).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Alliance's. Leaders of the Fang and Serpentbloom
# are the Horde's only.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses inside, so their goals stand
# at the door (@46.7,35.7, The Barrens) with `group 5`. The bosses come in the
# order of the client's dungeon journal (Lady Anacondra, Lord Cobrahn, Kresh,
# Lord Pythas, Skum, Lord Serpentis, Verdan the Everliving, Mutanus the
# Devourer), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by the quest
# log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each step
# ticked. Mad Magglish also wanders the caves outside the dungeon, on the
# Barrens map around the door.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items and rewards: Polestar's reference data (data/forever,
#   built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's Codex page for
#   the dungeon.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   17 to 24).
# - Lint warns that the door is more than 50 yards from the Devouring
#   Ectoplasms on the Barrens map, which drop the Wailing Essence outside too;
#   the goal stays at the door for the ectoplasms inside.

step Mebok Mizzyrix
  tip In Ratchet.
  accept 865

step Crane Operator Bigglefuzz
  accept 959

step Raptor Horns
  tip The Sunscale Scytheclaws carry them.
  collect 5055 x5 quest 865.1

step Mebok Mizzyrix
  turnin 865
  accept 1491

step Nalpak
  tip On the hill above the caverns.
  accept 1486

step Ebru
  accept 1487

step The caverns' mouth
  tip Outside the dungeon, in the caves around its door: Mad Magglish wanders here with the port.
  collect 5334 quest 959.1

step To the Wailing Caverns
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 17 to 24.
  enter "Wailing Caverns" @46.7,35.7

step Hides, essences and the deviates
  along until leave
  collect 6443 x20 quest 1486.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5 -- The deviate creatures and several bosses drop them.
  collect 6464 x6 quest 1491.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5 -- The Evolving and Nightmare Ectoplasms inside drop the essence; the Devouring Ectoplasms outside do too.
  kill 3636 x7 quest 1487.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5755 x7 quest 1487.2 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5761 x7 quest 1487.3 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5056 x7 quest 1487.4 @46.7,35.7 group 5

step Mutanus the Devourer
  tip The last boss in the client's journal, after the four Fanglords, Kresh, Skum and Verdan the Everliving. He drops a Glowing Shard, which starts a quest.
  collect 10441 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  accept 6981 @46.7,35.7

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short of the hides, the essence and the deviates, finish it before you go.
  collect 6443 x20 quest 1486.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  collect 6464 x6 quest 1491.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 3636 x7 quest 1487.1 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5755 x7 quest 1487.2 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5761 x7 quest 1487.3 @46.7,35.7 group 5
  kill 5056 x7 quest 1487.4 @46.7,35.7 group 5

step Nalpak
  turnin 1486

